  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"由 Serilum 開發的模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Wool Tweaks 對羊毛、床和地毯的染色機制進行了多項調整。不僅限於白色，任何顏色的羊毛均可在工作台中進行染色。此外，手持染料右擊已放置的區塊即可改變其顏色。內建將任意顏色羊毛轉換為 4 條線的合成配方。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"相依模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum&#x27;s QoL 套件\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"功能展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>手持染料右擊世界中的任何羊毛區塊以轉換顏色：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>展開詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>手持染料右擊世界中的任何床區塊以轉換顏色：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>展開詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"560\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>手持染料右擊世界中的任何地毯區塊以轉換顏色：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>展開詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>將任意羊毛區塊合成為 4 條線：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>為任意羊毛區塊染色：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/g.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>為任意床區塊染色：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/h.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>為任意地毯區塊染色：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/i.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/j.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，歡迎前往<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 專案頁面</a>反映。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
